WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 36]

01:48.140 --> 01:49.220
As

01:52.180 --> 01:54.110
Ze Shui from ten thousand years ago

01:54.770 --> 01:57.060
and Luo Ning ten thousand years later,

01:58.130 --> 01:59.979
I

02:00.580 --> 02:02.380
am here

02:04.300 --> 02:05.490
to pardon

02:06.220 --> 02:07.780
all Aquatic Demons

02:08.340 --> 02:10.860
and

02:12.100 --> 02:13.780
pardon

02:16.810 --> 02:18.180
Fu

02:21.340 --> 02:22.800
ten thousand years later.

02:26.940 --> 02:27.620
Luo Ning!

02:29.100 --> 02:31.060
Luo Ning!

03:26.420 --> 03:29.220
I really want you to pay with your life for Luo Ning.

03:29.300 --> 03:31.620
Even if you die a thousand or ten thousand times,

03:31.620 --> 03:33.220
you can't atone for your sin.

03:37.730 --> 03:39.460
The only reason I won't kill you

03:40.740 --> 03:42.340
is that Luo Ning forgave you.

03:43.980 --> 03:45.140
But I

03:46.620 --> 03:48.220
will never forgive you.

03:59.260 --> 04:00.940
Luo Ning.

04:51.050 --> 04:51.700
Tell me.

04:52.420 --> 04:54.350
Did I escort the bride for nothing?

04:54.540 --> 04:56.260
It would've been fine if somebody stole her away.

04:56.260 --> 04:57.460
We can steal her back.

04:58.020 --> 04:58.500
Why

04:59.980 --> 05:01.180
did she lose her life?

05:03.540 --> 05:04.980
I thought it was not safe

05:05.060 --> 05:07.720
when she said she wanted to marry the Demon King.

05:08.340 --> 05:09.860
But I never thought

05:11.140 --> 05:12.600
that Luo Ning would be with

05:13.660 --> 05:14.660
Fu.

05:16.420 --> 05:17.530
It's strange.

05:18.370 --> 05:19.860
Fu is not the Demon King.

05:20.380 --> 05:22.060
How can his spell be lifted

05:22.900 --> 05:24.360
after being with Luo Ning?

05:24.380 --> 05:26.260
Fu has the power of the Demon King,

05:27.740 --> 05:28.740
the one

05:28.940 --> 05:30.540
who had a grudge with Ze Shui.

05:32.100 --> 05:33.760
But what's strange now is that

05:38.460 --> 05:39.810
after Luo Ning died,

05:40.980 --> 05:42.840
there is no immortal energy left.

05:45.020 --> 05:46.940
Could it have fallen somewhere?

05:48.260 --> 05:50.500
It took her last wish before she died

05:51.100 --> 05:52.100
and went there.

05:53.860 --> 05:54.700
Impossible.

05:55.220 --> 05:56.740
With Luo Ge's cultivation,

05:56.740 --> 05:59.070
how could he not find the immortal energy?

05:59.260 --> 06:00.900
Luo Ge has only one sister.

06:01.620 --> 06:02.750
Who wouldn't be sad?

06:04.140 --> 06:05.020
I heard that

06:05.450 --> 06:08.710
Immortal Master was so sad that he didn't come out for days.

06:19.580 --> 06:20.420
Take a look.

06:21.020 --> 06:23.880
This is the Lily Magnolia Perfume I specially made.

06:24.370 --> 06:26.820
It can dispel cold and clear your nose.

06:27.300 --> 06:27.930
Are you

06:27.930 --> 06:29.990
suffering from fever, lung problem,

06:30.180 --> 06:31.300
and a stuffy nose

06:31.540 --> 06:33.300
because you're worried about my brother?

06:33.300 --> 06:34.980
I made this specially for you.

06:35.260 --> 06:36.659
Am I filial?

06:51.220 --> 06:52.930
I said no to your marriage,

06:53.700 --> 06:55.060
but you insisted.

06:56.620 --> 06:58.300
In that case,

06:58.980 --> 07:01.140
let the man you love

07:01.580 --> 07:02.860
pay with his life.

07:03.940 --> 07:06.420
It's something for me, too.

07:07.180 --> 07:08.300
OK?

07:27.740 --> 07:29.070
For the sake of the clan,

07:29.140 --> 07:29.780
for you,

07:30.260 --> 07:32.300
Luo Ning was willing to sacrifice herself.

07:32.300 --> 07:33.700
But now, your obsession

07:34.060 --> 07:35.590
attracted the evil spirit.

07:35.620 --> 07:37.420
It also caused Luo Ning's death.

07:38.300 --> 07:39.830
Although Luo Ge spared you,

07:39.900 --> 07:41.500
I can't let it go.

07:42.530 --> 07:43.659
When you get better,

07:44.380 --> 07:46.530
I'll go with you to get punished at the Immortal Palace.

07:46.530 --> 07:47.860
No punishment

07:48.380 --> 07:49.180
is too much.

07:55.020 --> 07:55.540
Fu,

07:57.300 --> 07:59.360
I've removed the evil spirit for you.

07:59.820 --> 08:01.020
But let me remind you.

08:01.780 --> 08:02.460
Never

08:02.460 --> 08:06.320
make contact with the evil creature under the Four Seasons Monument.

08:07.300 --> 08:08.760
The curse has been lifted.

08:09.620 --> 08:10.660
I owe my whole life

08:11.180 --> 08:12.100
to Luo Ge

08:13.100 --> 08:14.500
and Luo Ning.

08:16.380 --> 08:18.860
I can't do anything wrong to them anymore.

08:44.820 --> 08:45.350
Brother.

08:46.180 --> 08:47.710
What else do you want to say?

08:48.180 --> 08:51.040
Did you really not find Luo Ning's immortal energy?

08:52.060 --> 08:52.620
No.

08:55.420 --> 08:56.350
Luo Ning's death

08:58.340 --> 09:00.740
was caused by our marriage.

09:02.260 --> 09:03.460
I wronged her.

09:04.260 --> 09:06.790
The Demon Palace is even more indebted to her.

09:07.740 --> 09:08.740
And me.

09:10.770 --> 09:11.980
It's my fault.

09:14.420 --> 09:16.880
Even if I die hundreds or thousands of times,

09:18.540 --> 09:20.380
it is still not enough.

09:24.380 --> 09:26.380
You made such a huge mistake.

09:27.420 --> 09:30.480
Luo Ge and the Immortal Palace should decide your fate.

09:31.260 --> 09:33.990
I will continue to search for her immortal energy

09:34.380 --> 09:37.100
at the Great Wilderness and the Demon Palace where she died.

09:37.100 --> 09:38.300
If I can find it,

09:39.340 --> 09:41.470
it'll be something to remember her by.

09:45.420 --> 09:46.620
Take good care of him.

09:47.300 --> 09:48.220
But don't untie

09:48.460 --> 09:49.260
his chains.

09:51.620 --> 09:52.880
Guard more carefully.

09:53.620 --> 09:55.680
Check the boundary three times a day.

09:55.820 --> 09:56.620
Yes.

10:50.460 --> 10:51.620
Love

10:51.780 --> 10:53.380
is the most consuming thing.

10:53.380 --> 10:54.510
If you encounter it,

10:54.620 --> 10:57.280
it'll be unknown whether it is a blessing or not.

10:57.780 --> 11:00.040
If you encounter it, it'll be a blessing.

11:00.220 --> 11:02.350
But what if the ending is unfortunate?

11:02.370 --> 11:03.820
As long as it's my choice,

11:04.940 --> 11:06.060
whether it is

11:06.100 --> 11:07.180
good or bad,

11:08.020 --> 11:09.260
I'll have no regrets.

11:11.660 --> 11:13.920
Even if she knew the ending was like this,

11:14.780 --> 11:16.260
Luo Ning still forgave Fu.

11:17.860 --> 11:19.720
Just like ten thousand years ago,

11:20.180 --> 11:22.380
Ze Shui fell in love with the Demon King.

11:28.140 --> 11:29.740
I just want my brother to know

11:30.540 --> 11:31.860
I must become the Demon Queen

11:31.860 --> 11:33.020
and marry He Na.

11:34.020 --> 11:34.700
I promise

11:35.620 --> 11:36.980
I will be happy.

11:37.650 --> 11:38.580
Brother.

11:39.740 --> 11:40.270
Luo Ning.

11:43.130 --> 11:45.380
Let him go.

11:58.620 --> 12:00.180
Luo Ning! Luo Ning!

12:01.780 --> 12:02.650
Luo Ning!

12:06.740 --> 12:07.700
Luo Ning!

12:10.620 --> 12:12.680
Maybe I was wrong from the beginning.

12:14.420 --> 12:17.550
I shouldn't have stopped her from doing what she wanted.

12:18.780 --> 12:21.300
I should've let her live the way she wanted.

12:23.660 --> 12:25.060
I love it.

12:25.820 --> 12:27.050
You're the best.

12:36.100 --> 12:37.160
If I knew it sooner,

12:39.210 --> 12:41.940
I wouldn't have asked her to copy any scriptures.

12:43.100 --> 12:45.700
I would let her be free to see the outside world.

12:46.220 --> 12:46.780
Maybe

12:48.500 --> 12:50.160
this wouldn't have happened.

12:54.700 --> 12:56.020
Luo Ning and Ze Shui

12:57.340 --> 12:58.940
are both obsessed with love.

12:59.940 --> 13:01.220
Maybe the men they love

13:02.540 --> 13:04.450
are their inexorable doom.

13:05.460 --> 13:06.460
They can't escape

13:07.340 --> 13:08.340
or hide from them.

13:09.300 --> 13:10.630
But there're no regrets

13:12.060 --> 13:13.060
in love.

13:16.900 --> 13:17.690
Yes.

13:19.700 --> 13:21.220
Even if she met Fu,

13:22.900 --> 13:24.630
even if she forgot everything,

13:25.900 --> 13:28.960
in the end, there was only forgiveness and pardon left.

13:29.380 --> 13:31.310
There was no resentment or regret.

13:34.290 --> 13:35.700
But I still remember

13:37.060 --> 13:38.140
I always

13:40.300 --> 13:41.180
wanted to...

13:41.780 --> 13:42.310
Luo Ning.

13:42.660 --> 13:44.390
Break the curse for one person.

13:45.940 --> 13:46.740
Is it

13:49.820 --> 13:51.620
you?

14:17.300 --> 14:17.860
Liu Shao.

14:19.890 --> 14:21.550
During the time Luo Ning left,

14:23.250 --> 14:24.910
I'm glad to have you by my side,

14:26.100 --> 14:27.900
so I didn't fall into depravity.

14:29.900 --> 14:31.650
So no matter what happens,

14:33.940 --> 14:35.140
we should never let go

14:36.860 --> 14:37.940
or give up.

15:08.100 --> 15:08.660
Luo Ning.

15:09.540 --> 15:10.420
What else do you need?

15:10.420 --> 15:11.550
I'll find it for you.

15:14.730 --> 15:15.990
I don't need anything.

15:16.780 --> 15:17.940
I just

15:19.100 --> 15:20.230
came back to see you.

15:20.500 --> 15:21.380
Then,

15:22.060 --> 15:23.060
I'm leaving.

15:23.130 --> 15:24.060
You're leaving?

15:25.740 --> 15:26.870
Where are you going?

15:28.780 --> 15:29.820
To

15:31.220 --> 15:33.300
a very cold and dark place.

15:34.140 --> 15:35.470
But my brother is there.

15:36.220 --> 15:37.080
I'm not afraid.

15:38.050 --> 15:39.020
Take me with you.

15:41.100 --> 15:42.540
I can't take you with me.

15:43.500 --> 15:44.220
But

15:45.020 --> 15:46.060
you can come to me.

15:54.980 --> 15:56.580
Remember to come to me.

15:58.900 --> 16:00.180
I'll take the perfume

16:00.530 --> 16:01.620
with me.

16:02.620 --> 16:03.740
That place

16:03.940 --> 16:05.220
is really boring.

16:05.660 --> 16:06.210
So,

16:06.660 --> 16:07.660
you must come.

16:09.060 --> 16:10.060
I'll wait for you.

16:16.300 --> 16:16.860
Luo Ning.

16:25.300 --> 16:27.210
Who took Luo Ning's things?

16:29.860 --> 16:31.390
Could it really be Luo Ning?

16:32.690 --> 16:33.140
No.

16:35.900 --> 16:37.020
Luo Ning is dead.

16:37.900 --> 16:38.380
And

16:39.580 --> 16:41.260
I killed her myself.

16:43.140 --> 16:44.010
That's right.

16:45.780 --> 16:47.020
It was you

16:48.380 --> 16:50.020
who killed Luo Ning.

16:50.180 --> 16:51.180
Old man.

16:51.660 --> 16:52.460
It's you.

16:53.300 --> 16:55.570
You are the reason why I was in conflict with my brother.

16:55.570 --> 16:57.580
You are the reason why I was in conflict with the Immortal Palace,

16:57.580 --> 16:58.980
which led to Luo Ning's death.

16:58.980 --> 16:59.820
Fu,

17:00.020 --> 17:01.620
you're being unfair.

17:02.220 --> 17:04.180
Did I ask you to steal the bride?

17:04.410 --> 17:07.010
Did I ask you to give Luo Ning the Phoenix Tears?

17:07.020 --> 17:08.660
Or did I ask you to set up traps

17:08.660 --> 17:10.020
in the desert

17:10.140 --> 17:11.619
and put your brother and your beloved

17:11.619 --> 17:12.859
in danger?

17:14.660 --> 17:15.540
It's me.

17:15.660 --> 17:17.980
But don't be so sure.

17:18.290 --> 17:19.940
You still have a chance.

17:20.339 --> 17:21.069
Impossible.

17:22.260 --> 17:23.380
Luo Ning is dead.

17:23.500 --> 17:24.780
She won't show up again.

17:24.780 --> 17:26.109
But her immortal energy

17:26.260 --> 17:28.369
and the immortal energy of Ze Shui are one.

17:28.369 --> 17:29.140
However,

17:29.340 --> 17:30.800
the one under the Monument

17:31.180 --> 17:33.740
hid it under the Four Seasons Monument.

17:35.140 --> 17:36.070
What did you say?

17:36.620 --> 17:39.180
The immortal energy is hidden under the Four Seasons Monument.

17:39.180 --> 17:41.100
It's sealed with many boundaries.

17:41.100 --> 17:43.220
Naturally, even Luo Ge couldn't find it.

17:43.220 --> 17:44.700
If we break the Four Seasons Monument

17:44.700 --> 17:46.650
and release him to ascend to an immortal.

17:46.650 --> 17:48.450
By then, it won't be so difficult

17:48.580 --> 17:49.840
for him to save Luo Ning

17:50.010 --> 17:51.270
with his divine power.

17:53.300 --> 17:53.760
Really?

17:55.380 --> 17:56.710
Luo Ning could be saved?

17:57.460 --> 17:58.380
First,

17:58.860 --> 18:01.190
you need to help him ascend to an immortal.

18:04.060 --> 18:05.460
I'm going to

18:05.620 --> 18:07.980
a very cold and dark place.

18:09.180 --> 18:11.380
The very cold and dark place

18:11.740 --> 18:13.740
is under the Four Seasons Monument.

18:14.100 --> 18:15.300
Could it be that

18:15.980 --> 18:18.020
you don't want to save her?

18:20.260 --> 18:21.340
Who are you?

18:26.420 --> 18:27.380
That's right.

18:30.660 --> 18:31.700
It's you.

18:34.420 --> 18:36.260
I can help you save Luo Ning.

18:36.500 --> 18:38.100
Do you want to save her?

18:38.260 --> 18:39.620
Do you want freedom?

18:40.220 --> 18:42.060
Do you want to revive Luo Ning?

18:44.620 --> 18:45.300
Luo Ning.

18:48.740 --> 18:50.780
As long as you listen to me

18:51.220 --> 18:52.300
and obey me,

18:52.660 --> 18:55.260
I will give you the power to overturn the three worlds.

18:55.260 --> 18:56.990
Not only will I revive Luo Ning,

18:57.100 --> 18:58.100
I will also revive

18:58.930 --> 19:00.300
your children.

19:19.500 --> 19:20.660
A servant

19:21.580 --> 19:23.420
must act like a servant.

19:26.860 --> 19:28.260
You must come to me.

19:29.100 --> 19:30.100
I'll wait for you.

20:00.060 --> 20:03.260
The immortal energy of Luo Ning is under the Four Seasons Monument.

20:03.260 --> 20:05.460
If you break the Four Seasons Monument,

20:05.740 --> 20:08.740
I'll help you revive her.

20:13.140 --> 20:16.420
The younger generation of the clan has mostly migrated to the land.

20:16.420 --> 20:17.750
With their cultivation

20:17.930 --> 20:20.940
and the prestige you've built over the years,

20:21.180 --> 20:22.660
it will not be difficult

20:23.180 --> 20:24.440
to do something great.

20:24.580 --> 20:26.140
It seems the Aquatic Demons...

20:26.140 --> 20:26.660
No.

20:26.940 --> 20:29.780
It's almost time for the Melody Race

20:29.860 --> 20:31.190
to regain our prestige.

20:33.980 --> 20:34.780
Your Majesty.

20:36.820 --> 20:37.620
Your Majesty.

20:38.500 --> 20:40.960
The situation of our clan is getting better.

20:41.220 --> 20:43.220
Please take care of yourself.

20:43.420 --> 20:44.660
In the battle in the Great Wilderness,

20:44.660 --> 20:46.460
your organs were badly injured.

20:46.780 --> 20:49.980
And you held on to exorcise the evil spirit for General Fu.

20:50.290 --> 20:53.180
Thanks to the power of the water energy, you held on to now.

20:53.180 --> 20:55.820
It's time to recuperate for some time.

20:57.420 --> 20:58.060
I know.

21:03.060 --> 21:06.180
This will have to wait after I take Fu to confess his crime at the Immortal Palace.

21:06.180 --> 21:07.300
If I don't do these,

21:08.940 --> 21:10.600
my heart will never be at ease.

21:19.460 --> 21:20.020
Fu!

21:34.740 --> 21:35.420
Fu!

21:37.740 --> 21:38.410
Fu!

21:39.500 --> 21:40.060
Fu!

21:40.620 --> 21:41.620
What's wrong, Fu?

21:42.060 --> 21:42.620
Fu!

21:43.300 --> 21:44.060
Fu!

21:54.300 --> 21:55.160
What happened?

21:56.780 --> 21:58.040
There is an evil spirit

21:58.380 --> 22:00.180
combined with your spirit vein.

22:01.740 --> 22:03.200
It can't be removed at all.

22:10.180 --> 22:10.980
Because

22:12.420 --> 22:15.080
I volunteered to let him control my spirit vein.

22:15.460 --> 22:16.540
In exchange,

22:17.500 --> 22:20.060
I can borrow some of his power of Supreme God.

22:21.100 --> 22:22.030
What did you say?

22:34.620 --> 22:35.820
But to deal with Luo Ge

22:35.860 --> 22:37.660
and the entire Immortal Palace,

22:38.420 --> 22:39.820
it's still a long way off.

22:40.810 --> 22:41.450
Fu.

22:42.930 --> 22:44.980
Do you know what you are doing?

22:44.980 --> 22:46.660
I know exactly what I want.

22:47.330 --> 22:47.940
What I want

22:49.540 --> 22:50.690
is your power.

22:51.380 --> 22:54.020
Have you forgotten why Luo Ning died?

22:54.300 --> 22:56.570
I just can't forget how she died.

22:57.010 --> 22:58.380
I must find her.

23:02.020 --> 23:02.620
Fu.

23:05.020 --> 23:06.450
Luo Ning is dead.

23:07.780 --> 23:09.310
She can't come back to life.

23:10.020 --> 23:10.420
She's not.

23:10.420 --> 23:12.020
Don't keep making mistakes.

23:12.220 --> 23:12.820
She's not.

23:12.940 --> 23:13.800
She's not dead.

23:14.340 --> 23:15.260
She's not dead.

23:15.900 --> 23:17.580
As long as I get her immortal energy,

23:17.580 --> 23:18.980
she can come back to life.

23:20.100 --> 23:21.630
I dreamed of her yesterday.

23:22.860 --> 23:23.690
She told me

23:23.690 --> 23:25.300
she was trapped under the Four Seasons Monument.

23:25.300 --> 23:26.100
It's dark and cold there.

23:26.100 --> 23:28.030
She's waiting for me to pick her up.

23:28.740 --> 23:31.070
So I must break the Four Seasons Monument.

23:31.220 --> 23:32.290
I must save her.

23:36.060 --> 23:38.060
Don't put the three worlds in danger

23:38.100 --> 23:40.100
because of your personal interest.

23:42.380 --> 23:43.140
Brother.

23:44.860 --> 23:47.860
At this moment, I can't think that much anymore.

23:49.380 --> 23:50.340
This time,

23:51.060 --> 23:52.590
I just want to save Luo Ning.

23:53.740 --> 23:54.620
Save Luo Ning

23:56.220 --> 23:58.700
and our child.

24:00.660 --> 24:02.260
In a few months,

24:03.580 --> 24:06.060
a lovely child would have been born.

24:06.860 --> 24:08.860
That's all I want.

24:10.380 --> 24:11.100
You

24:11.380 --> 24:12.380
love me so much.

24:13.740 --> 24:14.860
I believe this time

24:19.700 --> 24:21.690
you will help me too.

24:25.020 --> 24:26.900
I need to borrow your water energy

24:27.420 --> 24:28.980
to have enough power

24:29.420 --> 24:31.420
to break the Four Seasons Monument.

24:35.100 --> 24:35.860
Fu,

24:38.690 --> 24:39.300
you will

24:39.420 --> 24:40.380
regret it.

25:26.540 --> 25:27.100
Brother,

25:28.460 --> 25:30.790
you once conquered the entire demon world

25:30.940 --> 25:32.470
in exchange for my freedom.

25:34.540 --> 25:35.580
And now,

25:36.900 --> 25:38.630
I want to use your water energy.

25:40.740 --> 25:42.540
After I rescue Luo Ning,

25:43.660 --> 25:45.260
you can do whatever you want.

25:47.340 --> 25:49.670
You can even cut me into a thousand pieces.

25:49.740 --> 25:50.370
Brother.

25:51.020 --> 25:51.780
I'm sorry.

26:12.580 --> 26:15.100
Fu.

26:21.180 --> 26:22.930
Fu.

27:22.460 --> 27:23.390
I saw it clearly.

27:26.300 --> 27:29.230
After observing the Seal of the Sun for so many times,

27:29.460 --> 27:30.740
I finally see clearly.

27:44.540 --> 27:46.180
I've grasped

27:46.500 --> 27:47.760
the way to seal the sun.

27:49.140 --> 27:51.020
But what happened back then

27:52.060 --> 27:53.320
that made God of the Sun

27:54.100 --> 27:54.940
so sad?

28:22.100 --> 28:23.300
God of the Moonlight.

28:24.220 --> 28:24.810
Luo Ge.

28:34.260 --> 28:34.820
Liu Shao.

28:35.930 --> 28:37.410
I've heard about

28:38.420 --> 28:40.150
the thing Crown Wheel told you.

28:40.700 --> 28:41.460
So,

28:41.810 --> 28:44.940
the two Gods were really incompatible as fire and water.

28:49.860 --> 28:51.260
Actually,

28:52.020 --> 28:55.860
the Sun and the Moonlight loved each other deeply.

28:59.340 --> 29:01.600
They are in charge of the sun and the moon.

29:01.940 --> 29:03.340
They shouldn't have met.

29:05.500 --> 29:07.740
But they fell in love at first sight

29:08.860 --> 29:10.700
in the Yin-yang Cave.

29:27.540 --> 29:29.070
But after they fell in love,

29:29.700 --> 29:31.060
the sun eclipsed,

29:31.580 --> 29:33.500
causing abnormal celestial phenomena.

29:33.500 --> 29:35.230
The three worlds were in chaos.

29:39.860 --> 29:41.320
For the sake of all beings,

29:42.060 --> 29:43.190
they had to separate

29:44.180 --> 29:46.440
and cultivate in seclusion separately.

29:53.580 --> 29:55.710
Since they had separated at that time,

29:56.140 --> 29:56.940
why

29:57.300 --> 29:58.900
did all those things happen?

29:59.140 --> 30:01.140
When the two gods were in seclusion,

30:01.340 --> 30:03.740
the Demon King died for Immortal Ze Shui.

30:04.740 --> 30:05.940
The immortal world had no master.

30:05.940 --> 30:07.600
The demon world had no leader.

30:08.540 --> 30:11.540
All kinds of obsession in the mortal world is growing.

30:12.220 --> 30:13.820
It accumulated in the world,

30:14.980 --> 30:16.780
became a powerful evil spirit

30:17.700 --> 30:18.540
and harmed

30:18.860 --> 30:19.860
the people,

30:20.260 --> 30:22.190
causing chaos in the three worlds.

30:23.380 --> 30:25.440
When the God of the sun heard about it,

30:26.500 --> 30:29.230
she decided to fight the evil spirit to the death.

30:30.140 --> 30:32.740
The God of the Moonlight couldn't bear to see the God of the Sun like this.

30:32.740 --> 30:34.600
In order to save the God of the Sun,

30:34.980 --> 30:36.620
he absorbed the evil spirit

30:37.900 --> 30:39.630
and sealed it with his own body.

30:39.900 --> 30:41.430
Sealed it with his own body?

30:42.020 --> 30:44.150
Then why did the God of the Sun kill him?

30:44.260 --> 30:47.340
Because the God of the Moonlight absorbed too much evil spirit.

30:47.340 --> 30:49.270
In the end, he was controlled by it.

30:49.940 --> 30:51.800
He's no longer the same as before.

30:53.060 --> 30:54.300
For the three worlds,

30:55.050 --> 30:57.510
the God of the Sun had to kill the one she love.

31:02.860 --> 31:03.720
You are not him.

31:03.860 --> 31:04.540
I am him.

31:06.020 --> 31:07.350
If you don't believe me,

31:09.420 --> 31:10.300
you can see yourself.

31:10.300 --> 31:12.160
One had compassion for the world,

31:12.180 --> 31:13.740
and the other brought disaster and turmoil to the three worlds.

31:13.740 --> 31:14.940
You are no longer him.

31:46.440 --> 31:49.240
The God of the Sun used the sword with all her might,

31:49.340 --> 31:52.270
and the God of the Moonlight's heart was split in two.

31:52.500 --> 31:54.430
The half tainted by the evil spirit

31:54.930 --> 31:57.420
was suppressed under the Four Seasons Monument.

31:57.420 --> 31:58.580
The remaining half

31:59.940 --> 32:00.540
is...

32:03.820 --> 32:05.100
I always worry that

32:05.980 --> 32:09.980
the evil creature and I each have half a heart of the God of the Moonlight.

32:10.100 --> 32:11.780
If one day,

32:13.100 --> 32:15.160
I was controlled by the evil creature

32:17.410 --> 32:19.140
like the God of the Moonlight.

32:24.140 --> 32:25.670
You are different from him.

32:26.060 --> 32:27.990
You are neither that evil creature

32:28.180 --> 32:29.780
nor the God of the Moonlight,

32:30.900 --> 32:32.100
but Luo Ge.

32:34.180 --> 32:36.910
You won't be devoured by the evil spirit like him.

32:41.540 --> 32:43.940
I'm afraid I can't protect the three worlds

32:44.340 --> 32:45.300
or you.

32:46.020 --> 32:47.700
If that day really comes,

32:48.860 --> 32:49.570
then

32:50.820 --> 32:52.480
I'll be the one to protect you.

33:00.140 --> 33:01.740
If you were the God of the Sun,

33:02.170 --> 33:03.570
what would you have done?

33:11.460 --> 33:13.660
I think I would've made the same choice.

33:14.700 --> 33:16.830
Although she broke her lover's heart,

33:17.380 --> 33:19.060
she avoided her lover

33:19.180 --> 33:21.040
being used by that evil creature.

33:22.260 --> 33:23.860
This is the greatest respect

33:24.250 --> 33:25.700
to a Supreme God.

33:34.740 --> 33:36.620
My brother has relapsed,

33:36.820 --> 33:38.580
so he couldn't attend to his duties.

33:38.580 --> 33:41.140
So he ordered me to temporarily take the title of Demon King,

33:41.140 --> 33:42.530
lead all demons

33:42.860 --> 33:44.410
and bring glory to the demon world.

33:44.410 --> 33:45.010
Everyone.

33:46.020 --> 33:46.930
Are you okay with that?

33:46.930 --> 33:49.500
The Demon King in White has relapsed.

33:50.140 --> 33:51.300
May I know

33:51.700 --> 33:53.580
how badly is the Demon King in White hurt that

33:53.580 --> 33:54.860
he had to pass the throne

33:54.860 --> 33:56.170
to his brother?

33:58.180 --> 33:58.980
That's right.

34:02.780 --> 34:03.980
We are of one mind.

34:04.300 --> 34:05.500
It doesn't matter

34:05.820 --> 34:06.690
who is the king.

34:07.260 --> 34:09.020
How badly is my brother hurt?

34:09.460 --> 34:10.719
It's not that serious.

34:10.980 --> 34:13.610
He just needs to rest.

34:14.380 --> 34:15.580
When he recovers,

34:15.860 --> 34:18.699
I will return the title of Demon King to him immediately.

34:18.699 --> 34:19.699
By then,

34:20.620 --> 34:22.080
I will still be an official

34:22.650 --> 34:23.909
and a younger brother.

34:24.179 --> 34:25.639
And he'll still be the king

34:26.460 --> 34:27.620
and an older brother.

34:27.620 --> 34:28.420
But we...

34:28.659 --> 34:29.980
we submitted to

34:30.179 --> 34:31.420
the Demon King in White,

34:31.420 --> 34:32.860
not you.

34:34.210 --> 34:35.100
In that case,

34:35.540 --> 34:37.060
let's present ourselves

34:37.219 --> 34:38.610
before the Demon King in White

34:38.610 --> 34:39.739
after he recovered.

34:39.940 --> 34:40.580
Let's go.

34:40.860 --> 34:41.300
Go.

34:41.380 --> 34:41.980
Go.

34:42.020 --> 34:42.540
Go.

34:42.610 --> 34:43.380
Let's go.

35:01.330 --> 35:02.460
How come Fu

35:02.860 --> 35:05.320
has the power of His Majesty's water energy?

35:12.140 --> 35:13.300
You don't think I'm qualified?

35:13.300 --> 35:15.630
You think I'm not as powerful as my brother

35:16.420 --> 35:18.660
and can't keep the demon world under control, right?

35:18.660 --> 35:19.380
I dare not.

35:19.660 --> 35:20.340
I dare not.

35:20.850 --> 35:21.860
In terms of cultivation,

35:21.860 --> 35:23.170
no one can compare with you.

35:23.170 --> 35:24.430
You're better than...

35:24.650 --> 35:25.980
the Demon King in White.

35:26.580 --> 35:28.260
It's my fault.

35:28.820 --> 35:30.420
Please spare my life.

35:32.380 --> 35:33.460
It's too late

35:34.460 --> 35:35.820
to beg for mercy now.

36:05.380 --> 36:07.380
Who else still has a second opinion?

36:09.700 --> 36:11.700
We are convinced.

36:12.260 --> 36:13.460
Greetings, our King.

36:13.700 --> 36:15.160
Greetings, Your Majesty.

36:19.580 --> 36:21.980
We are convinced.

36:22.140 --> 36:23.690
Greetings, our King.

36:23.860 --> 36:25.580
Greetings, Your Majesty.

36:25.820 --> 36:28.180
We are convinced.

36:28.340 --> 36:29.860
Greetings, our King.

36:30.020 --> 36:31.860
Greetings, Your Majesty.

36:32.900 --> 36:35.180
Everyone, lead your subordinates

36:35.740 --> 36:36.820
to get ready

36:37.540 --> 36:38.860
to do something great

36:39.020 --> 36:40.500
with me.

36:41.500 --> 36:42.460
By then,

36:42.700 --> 36:44.340
whether it is the demon world,

36:44.340 --> 36:45.200
the human world

36:46.340 --> 36:48.540
or that immortal world high above,

36:49.380 --> 36:50.110
they will all

36:51.210 --> 36:53.580
submit to me.

36:55.940 --> 36:58.180
We are willing to follow you

36:58.370 --> 36:59.830
to revitalize the Demons.

37:00.700 --> 37:03.100
We are willing to follow you

37:03.260 --> 37:04.820
to conquer the three worlds

37:05.060 --> 37:06.620
and revitalize the Demons.

37:06.940 --> 37:08.400
Conquer the three worlds!

37:08.620 --> 37:10.060
Revitalize the Demons!

37:10.380 --> 37:11.840
Conquer the three worlds!

37:12.020 --> 37:13.580
Revitalize the Demons!

37:13.860 --> 37:15.220
Revitalize the Demons!

37:15.540 --> 37:16.980
Revitalize the Demons!

37:17.220 --> 37:18.660
Revitalize the Demons!

37:18.900 --> 37:20.340
Revitalize the Demons!

37:20.620 --> 37:22.180
Revitalize the Demons!

38:36.260 --> 38:36.780
Fu,

38:37.900 --> 38:39.900
I indulged you too much these years

38:40.660 --> 38:42.190
and caused such a disaster.

38:43.180 --> 38:44.020
This time,

38:45.140 --> 38:46.780
you will pay the price.

38:50.340 --> 38:51.060
What?

38:51.210 --> 38:52.660
He Na gave the title of Demon King

38:52.660 --> 38:53.380
to Fu?

38:53.380 --> 38:54.220
That's right.

38:54.500 --> 38:55.140
The news

38:55.220 --> 38:56.980
has been spreading in the three worlds.

38:56.980 --> 38:58.980
He Na loves his brother too much.

38:59.300 --> 39:00.500
Even if he's injured,

39:00.780 --> 39:02.180
he should think about it.

39:02.380 --> 39:03.460
Fu

39:03.740 --> 39:05.780
looks like someone who will stir up trouble.

39:05.780 --> 39:07.300
Now he has the power,

39:07.540 --> 39:09.000
who knows what he might do?

39:12.660 --> 39:13.380
Are you going to scald me to death?

39:13.380 --> 39:14.140
I'm sorry.

39:14.980 --> 39:16.020
Blow it for me.

39:33.100 --> 39:33.830
You're here.

39:34.740 --> 39:35.540
You knew I was coming,

39:35.540 --> 39:36.580
so you were waiting for me.

39:36.580 --> 39:37.010
Yes.

39:37.700 --> 39:39.940
The demon world suddenly changed hands.

39:39.940 --> 39:41.270
I wonder what happened.

39:42.620 --> 39:44.550
Of course you're worry about He Na.

39:45.180 --> 39:46.450
Aren't you worried about him?

39:46.450 --> 39:48.110
If it weren't for his brother,

39:48.820 --> 39:50.900
Luo Ning wouldn't have died in the demon world.

39:50.900 --> 39:52.160
I don't want to see him.

39:55.980 --> 39:57.780
Even if you don't want to see him,

39:58.140 --> 39:59.670
if anything happens to him,

40:00.460 --> 40:02.020
will you really stand by?

40:02.460 --> 40:04.920
He Na has no precaution against his brother.

40:05.170 --> 40:06.660
He might be set up.

40:07.660 --> 40:08.660
But Fu

40:08.980 --> 40:10.640
would never kill his brother.

40:13.820 --> 40:14.500
Luo Ge.

40:15.220 --> 40:16.880
I want to go to the Demon Palace

40:17.130 --> 40:18.730
to ensure the safety of He Na.

40:19.380 --> 40:20.640
It may not be a bad idea.

40:21.060 --> 40:22.940
You've improved a lot on your cultivation.

40:22.940 --> 40:24.940
I don't think you're inferior to Fu.

40:28.420 --> 40:30.620
After you infiltrate the Demon Palace,

40:30.810 --> 40:32.140
remember to be careful.

40:33.180 --> 40:35.580
You'll have no problem getting out safely.

40:35.780 --> 40:36.660
Don't worry.

40:36.740 --> 40:38.140
Everything will be fine.

40:38.140 --> 40:40.450
Besides, I have the Moon Bell.

40:40.580 --> 40:43.040
I'll let you know if there's anything wrong.

40:43.860 --> 40:44.580
Bye.

41:03.740 --> 41:04.540
Your Majesty!

41:05.780 --> 41:06.620
Your Majesty!

41:12.060 --> 41:12.740
Mr. Tai.

41:14.980 --> 41:17.380
Has Fu taken over the title of Demon King?
